g" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:#141417" width="112"/><img class="lw-dark-only" alt="LangWatch" height="27" src="https://app.langwatch.ai/images/logo-full-darktheme.svg" style="display:none;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:#f5f4f1" width="112"/></td></tr></tbody></table><table width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-mesh" height="3" style="height:3px;line-height:3px;font-size:0;background-color:#ffcfa8;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff 0%, #ffaf6e 32%, #cddcf9 70%, #ffffff 100%);border-radius:2px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><h1 class="lw-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#141417">LangWatch hosted services for August 2026</h1><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">This is the statement for Acme Corp. Hosted services are invoiced every three months, so nothing here is due now.</p><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Instant Evals</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">184.32 USD</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Total for the month</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">184.32 USD</td></tr></tbody></table><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Prepaid commit for the term</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">5000.00 USD</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Drawn down so far</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">1212.40 USD</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Credit remaining</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">3787.60 USD</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Seats licensed</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">50</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:7px 16px 7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Seats reported</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">43</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Questions about a line on this statement? Reply to this message and we will explain it.</p><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:26px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">You receive this because you are the billing contact for a LangWatch license.</p><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">LangWatch ·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Documentation</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="mailto:support@langwatch.ai" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">support@langwatch.ai</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
