.ai/images/logo.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:#141417" width="112"/><img class="lw-dark-only" alt="LangWatch" height="27" src="https://app.langwatch.ai/images/logo-full-darktheme.svg" style="display:none;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:#f5f4f1" width="112"/></td></tr></tbody></table><table width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-mesh" height="3" style="height:3px;line-height:3px;font-size:0;background-color:#ffcfa8;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff 0%, #ffaf6e 32%, #cddcf9 70%, #ffffff 100%);border-radius:2px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><h1 class="lw-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.015em;color:#141417">Your request was not approved</h1><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Your request to join <strong>Acme Corp</strong> on LangWatch was not approved.</p><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">If you think that is a mistake, the people who can change it are your colleagues there — ask one of them for an invitation.</p><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:26px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#7272